      "Honda GXR120 engine with a long reputation for starting reliably",
      "Rated 48 to 57 dBA, quiet enough for tight lots",
      "About 47 pounds, a one-person lift",
      "CO-MINDER carbon monoxide shutoff",
      "Parallels with a second unit for about 3,600 running watts"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Priciest unit in its size class",
      "0.95-gallon tank needs frequent refills at heavier loads"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "If you buy one small generator and want it to start every time for a decade, this is it.",
