      "PowerRUSH technology helps start larger motor loads",
      "COsense carbon monoxide shutoff",
      "Inverter-clean power for electronics",
      "Parallel capable"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Open frame is louder than enclosed inverters",
      "Bulkier than suitcase units, so wheels or two hands needed"
